# Engineering standards

Generated by [keel](https://github.com/brizenchi/keel). The shared standards are
upgraded with `keel update` (local edits are kept); conventions specific to this
project live in [PROJECT.md](./PROJECT.md).

Every row says **where the rule is written** and **what enforces it**.

